    <string name="MiraUnleashed.Role.Mirage.WikiDescription">The Mirage is a Crewmate Support role that can place a decoy with the appearance of a chosen target (yourself or a random player). If any player interacts with the decoy, it disappears instantly and both the Mirage and the toucher receive a notification. Note: Mirage cannot be guessed if the decoy has the appearance of yourself.</string>
